  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Street Food at Temple Street Night Market</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>I always enjoy trying local dishes at Temple Street Night Market</li><li>Temple Spice Crabs is famous for its seafood selection, although my personal favorite is sweet and sour chicken</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Temple Street Night Market, Temple Street, Jordan",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Relax at Kowloon Park</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Between exploring the city, I like to take a break in Kowloon Park</li><li>The greenery and birdsong make you forget that you are in the middle of a busy metropolis</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Kowloon Park, 22 Austin Road, Tsim Sha Tsui",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_bann-thai_c_jeremy-cheung_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Cozy seating area with cushions and warm lighting in the Baan Thai Restaurant"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Dinner at Baan Thai</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>The Thai cuisine at Baan Thai is one of my favorite dining experiences in Hong Kong</li><li>My tip: be sure to reserve a table in advance</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Baan Thai, 57 Wyndham Street, Central",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_skyline_getty1297741599_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Illuminated Hong Kong skyline at night with light beams over the harbor"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>A Symphony of Lights</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Every evening at 8 PM, the “A Symphony of Lights” show transforms Victoria Harbour into a spectacular display of light and color</li><li>It only lasts a few minutes but is an unforgettable experience</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "A Symphony of Lights, Victoria Harbour",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Live Music at The Iron Fairies</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>I love ending the day with live music at The Iron Fairies in Central</li><li>It is the perfect place to experience Hong Kong’s vibrant nightlife</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "The Iron Fairies, 1 Hollywood Rd, Central",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Copyrights:&nbsp;Unsplash / Bady Abbas, Jeremy Cheung (2), Getty Images (3)",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>About</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Katja Tucich has been with Lufthansa since 1999 and is a big fan of Hong Kong. The city has always been one of her favorite destinations, and she also enjoys going there for a personal trip with her daughter.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
